190f103a63 test: check GetPruneRange on unvalidated snapshot

kills mutants https://mutanthub.space/mutants/4385 and
https://mutanthub.space/mutants/4386

checks prune range before a snapshot chain gets validated
ensures that pruning does not start before the snapshot block or
within the last 288 blocks.

diff --git a/src/validation.cpp b/src/validation.cpp
